Benefits & Features of the Bamboo Water Fountain

Zen-inspired Design: Embrace serenity with the calming presence of a bamboo water fountain, creating a peaceful atmosphere in your home or business.

Versatile Placement: Perfect for both indoor and outdoor settings, this fountain enhances patios, gardens, living rooms, and more with its natural beauty.

Easy Setup: With simple installation and minimal maintenance, you can enjoy the therapeutic benefits of flowing water without any hassle.

Customizable Flow: Adjust the water flow to your preference, whether you desire a gentle trickle or a more vigorous cascade, for a personalized experience.

Durable Construction: Crafted from high-quality bamboo, this fountain is built to withstand the elements, ensuring long-lasting enjoyment.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-17T15:47:40.040Z', '2026-08-20T11:38:39.535Z', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Introducing our Bamboo Water Fountain, where tranquility flows seamlessly into your space. Crafted with the finest bamboo and designed for both indoor and out', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bamboo Water Fountain: Serenity Meets Style');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "name", "slug", "category_id", "subcategory_id", "price", "discount_price", "sku", "stock", "avg_rating", "review_count", "tags", "is_featured", "is_new", "is_bestseller", "short_description", "description", "care_instructions", "craftsmanship_story", "created_at", "updated_at", "shipping_weight_kg", "package_length_cm", "package_width_cm", "package_height_cm", "seo_title", "seo_description", "seo_keywords", "canonical_url", "meta_robots", "og_title", "og_description", "og_image", "twitter_title", "twitter_description", "twitter_image", "image_alt_text") VALUES (11, 'Syngonium Verigated', 'syngonium-verigated', 1, 101, 470.00, NULL, NULL, 10000, 5.00, 0, ARRAY['Indoor Plants', 'Plants']::text[], FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'Syngonium Variegated, also known as Variegated Syngonium, is a cultivar of the Syngonium genus appreciated for its striking variegated foliage. Here are some key details about…', 'Syngonium Variegated, also known as Variegated Syngonium, is a cultivar of the Syngonium genus appreciated for its striking variegated foliage. Here are some key details about Syngonium Variegated:

Appearance: Syngonium Variegated features arrowhead-shaped leaves with variegated patterns of green, white, or cream. The variegation can vary between individual plants, with some displaying more white or cream markings than others. The leaves may change shape as the plant matures, developing more lobes and complexity.

Cultivation: Syngonium Variegated is commonly grown as a houseplant due to its attractive foliage and ease of care. It thrives in bright, indirect light but can also tolerate lower light conditions. Allow the soil to partially dry out between waterings to prevent overwatering and root rot.

Maintenance: Syngonium Variegated is relatively low-maintenance and requires minimal care once established. Prune the plant occasionally to remove dead or yellowing leaves and promote bushier growth. Fertilize sparingly during the growing season to encourage healthy growth.

Propagation: Syngonium Variegated can be propagated from stem cuttings. Simply cut a section of stem with a node and place it in water or moist soil until roots develop. Once rooted, the cutting can be potted up into its own container.

Versatility: Syngonium Variegated is versatile and can be used in various ways in indoor settings. It can be grown in hanging baskets, on shelves, or as a trailing plant in containers. Its variegated foliage adds color and interest to any space.', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-17T15:47:40.040Z', '2026-08-20T11:38:39.535Z', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Syngonium Variegated, also known as Variegated Syngonium, is a cultivar of the Syngonium genus appreciated for its striking variegated foliage. Here are some ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Syngonium Verigated');
